{"ts":"2026-11-12T16:49:25Z","sha":"df2561e7183a5d5f787ab7c01ead0f43aba75ae9","round":2,"kind":"finding","file":"src/components/candidate/row-actions.test.tsx","title":"Hình dạng 4 (chỉ có khẳng định âm, không có đối chứng dương): nút chính của RecordActions chỉ được kiểm là vắng mặt","severity":"medium","source":"carried","inContract":false,"acRef":"","plain":"The tests check that the main button disappears when not allowed, but not that it appears when allowed. A record page that never shows its main button could slip through the tests.","can_cu":"Other tests and screenshots already show the buttons, so the risk is small and anyone can notice a missing button at once; adding the check later is cheap.","proposal":"known-limits","khongBacBo":true,"unverified":false,"unclassified":false,"carried_from_round":1}
{"ts":"2026-11-12T16:49:25Z","sha":"df2561e7183a5d5f787ab7c01ead0f43aba75ae9","round":2,"kind":"finding","file":"src/components/candidate/row-actions.test.tsx","title":"Hình dạng 4 (chỉ có khẳng định âm): «the rest stays» không được đo","severity":"medium","source":"carried","inContract":false,"acRef":"","plain":"On someone else's record, the tests do not confirm that actions everyone may use still appear. A bug hiding the whole menu there would not be caught.","can_cu":"The behaviour is probably right today and a missing menu is visible immediately, so the harm is low and the test can be strengthened cheaply later.","proposal":"known-limits","khongBacBo":true,"unverified":false,"unclassified":false,"carried_from_round":1}
{"ts":"2026-11-12T16:49:25Z","sha":"df2561e7183a5d5f787ab7c01ead0f43aba75ae9","round":2,"kind":"finding","file":"tests/e2e/bo-nut.spec.ts","title":"Hình dạng 4 (chỉ có khẳng định âm, không ghim thông điệp): vai không có ô xem chỉ được kiểm là không có «…»","severity":"medium","source":"carried","inContract":false,"acRef":"","plain":"For a role without view rights, the test confirms no menu shows but not that the person sees the «not allowed» message. A blank area would pass the test.","can_cu":"The person would only see an empty area instead of a message, which is confusing but harmless and leaks no data; the sample page is the only place affected.","proposal":"known-limits","khongBacBo":true,"unverified":false,"unclassified":false,"carried_from_round":1}
{"ts":"2026-11-12T16:49:25Z","sha":"df2561e7183a5d5f787ab7c01ead0f43aba75ae9","round":2,"kind":"finding","file":"tests/e2e-db/bo-nut-members.spec.ts","title":"Hình dạng 2 (fixture viết tay đúng khuôn bên đọc): mục Thành viên của thanh bên được dựng lại bằng regex trên nguồn","severity":"medium","source":"carried","inContract":false,"acRef":"","plain":"The test for the Members sidebar entry rebuilds the entry itself rather than using the real one. If the real entry is later written differently, the test could stay green while the sidebar misbehaves.","can_cu":"The sidebar works today and a wrong entry would be seen at once; the risk is only that a future change goes unflagged by this one test.","proposal":"known-limits","khongBacBo":true,"unverified":false,"unclassified":false,"carried_from_round":1}
{"ts":"2026-11-12T16:49:25Z","sha":"df2561e7183a5d5f787ab7c01ead0f43aba75ae9","round":2,"kind":"finding","file":"tests/e2e-db/bo-nut-members.spec.ts","title":"Hình dạng 4 (khẳng định âm không ghim vào nguồn): câu lỗi chung là chuỗi viết tay","severity":"low","source":"carried","inContract":false,"acRef":"","plain":"If the wording of the general error message changes, the test could no longer tell it apart from the specific «not allowed» message. People would still see the right messages.","can_cu":"Users are unaffected and it only matters if someone rewords the message, in which case the test needs a one-line update.","proposal":"known-limits","khongBacBo":true,"unverified":false,"unclassified":false,"carried_from_round":1}
